<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>NTIC SOLUTION · Jour 6 — Création d'application mobile avec AppCreator24</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --bleu: #0B3FA5;
            --bleu-clair: #e8f0fe;
            --bleu-fonce: #072a6e;
            --orange: #FF6B35;
            --orange-clair: #fff4e5;
            --vert: #059669;
            --vert-clair: #ecfdf5;
            --violet: #7c3aed;
            --violet-clair: #f3e8ff;
            --rouge: #dc2626;
            --rouge-clair: #fef2f2;
            --jaune: #f59e0b;
            --jaune-clair: #fffbeb;
            --gris: #f1f5f9;
            --gris-fonce: #475569;
            --texte: #1e293b;
            --blanc: #ffffff;
            --bordure: #e2e8f0;
            --shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --radius: 16px;
            --transition: 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background: #0d1117;
            color: var(--texte);
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .presentation-container {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: #0d1117;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .slide-stage {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .slide-content {
            background: var(--blanc);
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 3rem 4.5rem;
            position: relative;
            animation: slideIn 0.5s ease;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.96) translateY(12px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
        }

        .progress-bar {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            z-index: 200;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--orange);
            transition: width 0.4s ease;
            border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
        }

        .slide-counter {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 1.2rem;
            left: 1.5rem;
            z-index: 200;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .nav-hint {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 1.2rem;
            right: 1.5rem;
            z-index: 200;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        .anim-item {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(24px);
            animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards;
        }
        .anim-item:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.45s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.55s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 0.65s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(8) { animation-delay: 0.75s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(9) { animation-delay: 0.85s; }
        .anim-item:nth-child(10) { animation-delay: 0.95s; }

        @keyframes fadeUp {
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        h1 { font-size: 3.2rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1.5px; color: var(--bleu); line-height: 1.1; }
        h2 { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bleu); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; }
        h4 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; }
        p { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--gris-fonce); }
        .subtitle { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--gris-fonce); }

        .slide-cover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bleu-fonce) 0%, #0d1b3e 100%);
            color: var(--blanc);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .slide-cover h1 { color: var(--blanc); font-size: 3.5rem; }
        .slide-cover .subtitle { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
        .slide-cover p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
        .slide-cover .highlight { color: var(--orange); }

        .slide-next {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange) 0%, #e55a2b 100%);
            color: var(--blanc);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .slide-next h1, .slide-next h2 { color: var(--blanc); }
        .slide-next p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }

        .slide-objectifs { background: var(--bleu-clair); }
        .slide-exercice { background: var(--orange-clair); }
        .slide-exercice h2 { color: #a0401a; }
        .slide-recap { background: var(--vert-clair); }
        .slide-recap h2 { color: #064e3b; }

        .objectif-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            padding: 0.8rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }
        .objectif-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .objectif-num {
            background: var(--bleu);
            color: var(--blanc);
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .objectif-text { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--texte); }

        .card-grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .card-grid.cols-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        .card-grid.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
        .card-grid.cols-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }

        .card {
            background: var(--gris);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--bordure);
            text-align: center;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
        .card i { font-size: 2.6rem; color: var(--bleu); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
        .card h4 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
        .card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--gris-fonce); }

        .box {
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 1.2rem 1.8rem;
            margin: 1.2rem 0;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-left: 6px solid;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .box i { font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.15rem; }
        .box-tip { background: var(--bleu-clair); border-color: var(--bleu); color: #0a2c5c; }
        .box-important { background: var(--orange-clair); border-color: var(--orange); color: #6b3a1f; }
        .box-success { background: var(--vert-clair); border-color: var(--vert); color: #064e3b; }
        .box-warning { background: var(--rouge-clair); border-color: var(--rouge); color: #7f1d1d; }
        .box-info { background: var(--violet-clair); border-color: var(--violet); color: #3b0764; }

        .table-wrapper {
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin: 1.2rem 0;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            border: 1px solid var(--bordure);
        }
        .table-simple {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            background: var(--blanc);
        }
        .table-simple th {
            background: var(--bleu);
            color: var(--blanc);
            padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .table-simple td {
            padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bordure);
        }
        .table-simple tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        .table-simple tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #fafbfc; }
        .table-simple tr:hover td { background: var(--bleu-clair); }

        .tag-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .tag-card {
            background: var(--blanc);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--bordure);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .tag-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }
        .tag-card .tag-name {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--bleu);
            color: var(--blanc);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }
        .tag-card .tag-usage { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gris-fonce); margin-top: 0.3rem; }
        .tag-card .tag-example {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            background: var(--gris);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 0.3rem;
            color: var(--bleu-fonce);
        }
        .tag-card .tag-role { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--texte); }

        .exercice-box {
            background: var(--blanc);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 2rem;
            border: 2px solid var(--bleu);
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }
        .exercice-box h3 { color: var(--bleu); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .exercice-box ol { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
        .exercice-box li { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; color: var(--texte); }

        .step-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .step-card {
            background: var(--blanc);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--bordure);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .step-card .step-num {
            background: var(--bleu);
            color: var(--blanc);
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .step-card .step-content h4 { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--bleu); }
        .step-card .step-content p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--gris-fonce); }

        .compare-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .compare-col {
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .compare-col.negative { background: var(--rouge-clair); border: 2px solid var(--rouge); }
        .compare-col.positive { background: var(--vert-clair); border: 2px solid var(--vert); }
        .compare-col .icon-big { font-size: 3.2rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .compare-col h3 { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
        .compare-col ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; text-align: left; }
        .compare-col ul li { padding: 0.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); font-size: 1.05rem; }
        .compare-col ul li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .compare-col.negative ul li::before { content: "✗ "; color: var(--rouge); font-weight: 700; }
        .compare-col.positive ul li::before { content: "✓ "; color: var(--vert); font-weight: 700; }

        pre {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        code {
            background: var(--gris);
            padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: var(--bleu-fonce);
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .slide-content { padding: 2.5rem 3rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .slide-content { padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem; }
            h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
            h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
            p { font-size: 1rem; }
            .subtitle { font-size: 1.2rem; }
            .card-grid.cols-2, .card-grid.cols-3, .card-grid.cols-4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .tag-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .step-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
            .table-simple { font-size: 0.85rem; }
            .table-simple th, .table-simple td { padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; }
            .slide-cover h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .slide-next h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .nav-hint, .slide-counter { font-size: 0.6rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem; }
            .objectif-text { font-size: 1rem; }
            .objectif-num { width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 1rem; }
            .box { font-size: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; }
            .exercice-box { padding: 1.2rem; }
            .exercice-box li { font-size: 0.95rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .slide-content { padding: 1.2rem 1rem; }
            h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
            h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="presentation-container">
        <div class="slide-stage" id="slideStage"></div>
        <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>
        <div class="slide-counter" id="slideCounter">1 / 22</div>
        <div class="nav-hint">← → naviguer · Escape quitter</div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const slidesData = [{
            content: `
                    <h1 class="anim-item">Creation d'application mobile <span class="highlight">sans code</span></h1>
                    <p class="subtitle anim-item">Jour 6 — AppCreator24 : de l'idee a l'application publique</p>
                    <p class="anim-item" style="font-size:1.3rem; margin-top:0.5rem;">
                        Application · Site web · No-Code · Deploiement
                    </p>
                    <div style="margin-top:2rem;">
                        <p class="anim-item" style="font-size:1.1rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                            <i class="fas fa-map-pin"></i> NTIC Solution — Banfora, Burkina Faso
                        </p>
                        <p class="anim-item" style="font-size:0.95rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); margin-top:0.5rem;">
                            Duree : 2 heures · Niveau : Debutant
                        </p>
                    </div>
                `,
            className: 'slide-cover'
        }, {
            content: `
                    <h2 class="anim-item">Objectifs du Jour 6</h2>
                    <p class="anim-item" style="font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--gris-fonce); margin-bottom:1rem;">
                        A la fin de cette seance, chaque participant saura :
                    </p>
                    <div>
                        <div class="objectif-item anim-item">
                            <div class="objectif-num">1</div>
                            <div class="objectif-text">Definir ce qu'est une application mobile et la differencier d'un site web</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="objectif-item anim-item">
                            <div class="objectif-num">2</div>
                            <div class="objectif-text">Identifier les avantages d'une application pour une entreprise ou une activite</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="objectif-item anim-item">
                            <div class="objectif-num">3</div>
                            <div class="objectif-text">Creer une application complete sur AppCreator24</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="objectif-item anim-item">
                            <div class="objectif-num">4</div>
                            <div class="objectif-text">Personnaliser l'application (couleurs, icones, sections, menus)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="objectif-item anim-item">
                            <div class="objectif-num">5</div>
                            <div class="objectif-text">Publier et partager l'application</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                `,
            className: 'slide-objectifs'
        }, {
            content: `
                    <h2 class="anim-item">Qu'est-ce qu'une application mobile ?</h2>
                    <p class="anim-item" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
                        Une <strong>application mobile</strong> est un logiciel concu pour fonctionner sur un appareil mobile (smartphone, tablette).
                    </p>
                    <div class="card-grid cols-2 anim-item" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
                        <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--vert);">
                            <i class="fas fa-mobile-alt" style="color:var(--vert);"></i>
                            <h4>Application native</h4>
                            <p>Installee directement sur l'appareil. Disponible via les stores (Google Play, App Store).</p>
                            <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--gris-fonce);">Exemple : WhatsApp, Facebook, TikTok</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--bleu);">
                            <i class="fas fa-globe" style="color:var(--bleu);"></i>
                            <h4>Application web (PWA)</h4>
                            <p>Accessible via navigateur. Peut etre ajoutee a l'ecran d'accueil.</p>
                            <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--gris-fonce);">Exemple : Twitter Lite, Starbucks</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="box box-important anim-item">
                        <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
                        <div><strong>Aujourd'hui :</strong> Nous creons une application <strong>no-code</strong> avec AppCreator24, accessible sur Android.</div>
                    </div>
                `,
            className: ''
        }, {
            content: `
                    <h2 class="anim-item">Application vs Site web : quelles differences ?</h2>
                    <div class="compare-grid anim-item">
                        <div class="compare-col positive">
                            <span class="icon-big">📱</span>
                            <h3 style="color:var(--vert);">Application</h3>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Acces hors ligne (partiel ou total)</li>
                                <li>Notifications push (alertes en temps reel)</li>
                                <li>Acces aux fonctionnalites du telephone (GPS, camera, contacts)</li>
                                <li>Meilleure experience utilisateur (UI/UX)</li>
                                <li>Fidelisation via l'icone sur l'ecran d'accueil</li>
                                <li>Monetisation possible (publicite, in-app purchases)</li>
